# requires: saves
# bodies: inzar (her sword and spells; gun bodies: character_boss_lain_*)
# Inzar vs Lain (kotukoru_ai) in Kotukoru_d, slot 26 = kayit25.sav. The intro movie is skipped with Escape (kotu_koruyucu.wdl:6466).
# Lain closes in and hits (Kotukoru_Kontrol/Kos/FirstVur), Inzar's sword combos (koruyucu.wdl:3434, Key_SilahKaldir) drain its Enerji,
# A round that stalls (Lain out of reach) ends after 420 frames and the next round re-aims.
# Between rounds Inzar holds D (up to 600 frames, so a low-health Inzar recovers before the next round attacks) to channel energy back (koruyucu.wdl:1572, my.enerji+=6.25/3*time).
# Kotukoru_Ol (kotu_koruyucu.wdl:6200) plays the death camera, sets lain_sona_erdi=1 and LY_HedefLevel=84 (Buyukes, Demir, buyukes_koruses :6509).
# Lain's attack choices are randomize()+random() (kotu_koruyucu.wdl:1373 ...); the scenario's fixed random() seed (default 0,
# "seed N" to change) makes the fight reproducible: seed 0 ends at frame 19669; seeds 1-4 also pass (docs/GAMEPLAY_TESTING.md fix 13).
realtime off
load-save 25
wait until LY_AktifLevelID == 98 && level_yuklendi_ok == 1 && player != 0 timeout 7200
assert $level == "kotukoru_d.wmb"
assert Aktif_Player == 2
assert lain_sona_erdi == 0
find boss kotukoru_ai
assert @boss.skill1 >= 1280
wait until $movie timeout 1200
frames 60
capture inzar_lain_intro
press Escape
wait until koruyucu_pasif == 0 && $movie == 0 timeout 1200
store hp0 koru_yaralanma
wait until $dist(@boss) < 80 timeout 1800
wait until koru_yaralanma < @hp0 timeout 1800
capture inzar_lain_attacks
store b0 @boss.skill1
turn-to @boss 20 timeout 900
press-until S @boss.skill1 < @b0 timeout 900
assert kotukoru_yaralanma >= @boss.skill1
capture inzar_lain_hit
turn-to @boss 20 timeout 900
store g $frame
press-until S @boss.skill1 < 1150 || koru_yaralanma < 110 || $frame > @g + 420 timeout 1800
store f $frame
down D
wait until koru_yaralanma > 190 || $frame > @f + 600 || @boss.skill1 <= 0 timeout 700
up D
turn-to @boss 20 timeout 900
store g $frame
press-until S @boss.skill1 < 1100 || koru_yaralanma < 110 || $frame > @g + 420 timeout 1800
store f $frame
down D
